    "long_instructions": "## Define Your Project\r\nGoal: Plan your model before you train it.\r\n\r\nHave **My Data** from your guide open. Move your Data Scientist to each stop as you start it. Click the zoom **+** in the bottom corner of the map.\r\n- **Define Stop 1:** Drag the star to the label you wrote in My Data.\r\n- **Define Stop 2:** Write who will use your model: one person or one type of person.\r\n- **Define Stop 3:** Drag your two features from My Data into the boxes. Write why you picked them.\r\n- **Define Stop 4:** Finish the \"If ..., then ...\" rule with your two features. Don't train yet.\r\n\r\nYou are done when Define Stops 1–4 have an answer. Go to the next level.",
